<title>UK: TABLE-ED&amp;F Man year profits up five percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ED&amp;F Man year profits up five percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.0		   vs  21.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  7.3		   vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.7		   vs  10.1</p>
<p> Pretax		     85.2		   vs  81.1</p>
<p> Trading profit	  283.8		   vs 267.4</p>
<p> Operating profit	 96.5		   vs  98.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profits were reduced by 3.4 million stg as a result of sterling's strength. Using last year's exchange rates, pretax profits would have been 88.6 million stg, up nine percent on the year.</p>
<p>Full name of Commodities and financial services company - E D &amp; F Man Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
